<section id="api" class="flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col gap-8">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">API reference</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Helpers render semantic HTML and include their interaction wiring. Pass native attributes through <code>class:</code>, <code>data:</code>, <code>aria:</code> and the usual Rails options. Blocks use captured ERB content.</p>
  <% showcase_builders(section).each do |component| %>
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 id="<%= component.name %>" class="scroll-mt-28 font-mono text-sm font-medium"><%= component.name %></h3>
      <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl bg-paper-2 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-ink-2"><code><%= component.signature %></code></pre>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full min-w-80 text-start text-sm">
          <thead><tr class="text-xs text-ink-3"><th class="py-3 pe-4 text-start font-medium">Input</th><th class="py-3 pe-4 text-start font-medium">Default</th><th class="py-3 text-start font-medium">Values</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <% showcase_parameters(component).each do |name, default| %>
              <tr class="border-t border-hairline"><td class="py-3 pe-4 align-top font-mono text-xs"><%= name %></td><td class="py-3 pe-4 align-top font-mono text-xs"><%= default %></td><td class="py-3 align-top text-xs text-ink-2"><%= showcase_choices(component, name) %></td></tr>
            <% end %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-paper-2 p-5 text-sm text-ink-2">
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">Styling and extension</h3>
    <p>Use <code>class:</code> to merge utilities, native attributes for application behavior, and <a href="/tokens.html" class="underline underline-offset-2">theme tokens</a> for the shared palette. For custom markup, the <a href="https://github.com/lostcoords/ui#advanced-style-composition" class="underline underline-offset-2">advanced class helpers</a> expose the same styles, including glass surfaces and class merging.</p>
    <p><a href="/api.json" class="underline underline-offset-2">API JSON</a> · <a href="/llms.txt" class="underline underline-offset-2">LLM reference</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
